('xiaomi-smart-camera-c500-dual', 'Xiaomi C500 Dual 4K PTZ Smart Camera with AI Tracking - White', 'smart-home', 65000, 63900, 52000, 18, 0.55, '/assets/products/xiaomi-c500-dual.webp', 'Dual-lens design provides simultaneous wide-angle overview and PTZ close-up tracking. The 4K resolution with AI human and pet detection, 360° pan, 110° tilt, and two-way audio make this Xiaomi''s most advanced indoor security camera for complete room coverage.', 1, unixepoch('2026-06-16'), 1, 52000, '/assets/products/xiaomi-c500-dual.webp', 59000, 4.5, 0, 'Xiaomi', 1, 1),

