('tp-link-tapo-c520ws-outdoor', 'TP-Link Tapo C520WS 2K Outdoor Pan-Tilt WiFi Camera with Spotlight', 'smart-home', 75000, 72900, 62000, 15, 0.85, '/assets/products/tapo-c520ws.webp', 'Deter intruders with motion-activated spotlights, a built-in siren, and two-way audio. The 2K QHD resolution with Starlight sensor provides full-color night vision, while the 360° pan and 130° tilt eliminate blind spots. IP66 weatherproof for Nigerian rain and dust.', 1, unixepoch('2026-06-16'), 1, 62000, '/assets/products/tapo-c520ws.webp', 69000, 4.5, 1, 'TP-Link', 1, 1),

